@Component({
    standalone: true,
    imports: [
      ...
      FormsModule,
      ...
    ],
    ...
})
export class TaskComponent {
    ...

If the task is not standalone, go to the place where you delared the component declarations array. Then import FormModule.
@NgModule({
    ...
    imports: [
      ...
      FormsModule,
      ...
    ]
    ...
})
export class SomeModule {}

